  "ui_selection_rule": "The crafting UI obtains active server forge_season_no values, takes the matching (raw_formula_no, season_no) row when available, suppresses the base row when an active season override exists, then checks disabled formula list, valid_time, hidden/display field and live meme unlock. The generic resolver falls back to scalar base when no active tuple exists.",
